# NOTE: this app is self-contained — the VSM thin jars (app/libs/*.jar) and the character
# page (assets/character.html, assets/vm-adapter.js) are COMMITTED so it builds without the
# parent repo. Refresh them with `./gradlew refreshVsmArtifacts` (parent repo only).
#
# The VuppetMaster license key lives in local.properties (never committed, see
# local.properties.template) and is injected via BuildConfig. The committed project.xml
# keeps an empty licenseKey.
